QY_07xlbRzQgQZkY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXoNWwqOtmrexpnFKvJun46hktITcGEb7JPF-n5DR1_Kw&oe=6B0F1652"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1_gallery.png", "id": "214190206012811", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12482172_214190209346144_9130900678007324672_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iTc6_jdHKK4Q7kNvwFGmbyO&_nc_oc=Adp9FbhS5Q9d7NTZ2Cu0FRZMHhdFq1YEY3tbeZ67TDx2EpNc7HH6FLB0xg8OlMvSeYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXwnSiroCGmMgz5VZpq_FBNtTvtbsLZ0x3Fejbzt_vsVA&oe=6B0EFD8B"}, "display_name": "Dreadhalls Demo", "keywords": ["scary", "dungeon", "dread", "horror", "fear"], "long_description": "Experience a new kind of immersive horror in Dreadhalls!\n\nYou are trapped deep inside a massive dungeon. Explore it, survive it, and find a way to escape. Your only weapons will be stealth, your own courage, and a faint light.\n\nInspired by the survival horror and roguelike genres, Dreadhalls has been terrorizing people ever since its debut at the 2013 Oculus + Indiecade VR Jam.\n\nDreadhalls is an intense and scary experience, not for the faint of heart. You have been warned!", "short_description": "You are trapped deep inside a massive dungeon. Explore it, survive it, and find a way to escape. Your only weapons will be stealth, your own courage, and a faint light."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.whitedoorgames.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.whitedoorgames.com/tos.html", "publisher_name": "White Door Games", "support_website_url": "http://dreadhalls.com/contact", "website_url": "http://www.dreadhalls.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscript